// The final Protocol page's drawings (ProtocolFinal.tsx): the isometric plates of near-homepage-directions.vercel.app/protocol (stack-kit r41,
// <page>/art/<id>.svg), inlined so the page has them at first paint and the motion (art.ts) can reach their paths. Generated from those files by a
// one-off script (comments stripped, nothing else changed): to update one, replace its string with the new file's <svg>…</svg>.
// The art contract (theirs): .ln strokes, .dsh dashed strokes, .fl floors, .fc faces, .dt dots, .hi the mint mark, .lt a small mark that lights,
// [data-part] a piece a link can light (the hero's six parts, the shelf's five sheets), .orbit the quantum dial's dashed ring.

